-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Oct 18 09:21:37 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 3.1.0:
  * Revamped text rendering engine based on HarfBuzz: complex text
    layouts, bidirectional text and more glyph-level information.
  * Network module: TLS and HTTPS support, IPv6, SFTP replacing FTP,
    and a new DNS client.
  * Graphics: support for the QOI image format and Unicode 17.0.
  * Audio: improved device and stream rerouting management, updated
    bundled miniaudio.
  * Fixed X11 window implementation issues and Unicode filename
    handling in several modules.
- SONAME bump 3.0 -> 3.1: library subpackage renamed to libsfml3-3_1.
- New BuildRequires on harfbuzz, mbedtls and libssh2 for the text
  and network modules; SheenBidi (no system package) is built from
  a vendored copy of its v3.0.0 sources; spec cleanup (ldconfig
  scriptlets, dropped Group tags).

